globalThis.KPMarriageSource={"metadata":{"filename":"Marriage-points.txt","sha256":"8218aa9b28488bec8c317e56e19761bf74ae8822ca5137f61d5299e6d479f714","points":19,"policy":"Curated evaluator implements explicit KP promise/denial/delay and related conditions. Source grid is interleaved, not a simple row-per-rule list. Undefined full connections and missing second-person RP remain review-only. Sensitive personal behavior and survival are not inferred."},"appearanceEnglish":["then the person will generally be of average height and possess lean and muscular body (neither stout nor thick). He/She may be of wheatish complexion with expressive eyes, long face and curly hair.","then the person will generally be of medium stature with broad forehead, thick neck and bright eyes.He/She may have dark hair, fair complexion, broad shoulders,well developed muscles and will be of cheering personality.","then the person will generally be tall and upright coupled with moderate complexion (neither too fair nor too dark). He/She may have long hands, sharp eyes, long nose and charming personality.","then the person will generally be of short stature with heavy body, slender limbs, powerful claws and prominent abdomen. The portion above abdomen will be more\nprominent than the lower parts. He/She may also walk with a rolling gait/pace.","then the person will generally be of moderate stature with a muscular body, well developed bones and broad forehead. He/She may have royal outlook, dignified personality and commanding appearance.","then the person will generally have a tall and slender body. He/She may have shrill voice and curved eyebrows with bushy hair. He/She may often appear to be younger than his/her actual age. They will be very active and brisk walking people.","then the person will generally be of tall stature with well-proportioned body having slender but strong limbs and parrot like nose. He/She may be graceful and have humanitarian instincts with charming appearance and influential personality.","then the person will generally be of average stature with well-proportioned body having long hands and broad face. He/She may have commanding appearance with good and respectful personality.","then the person will generally be of tall stature with well-developed muscles and broad forehead.He/She may have bushy eyebrows, long nose, graceful bright eyes, smiling face, fair complexion and handsome figure.","then the person will generally be emaciated, gaunt and weak. He/She may have long nose, deep set eyes, and coarse hair but the body growth will be slow.","then the person will generally be tall having fair complexion and handsome appearance.","then the person will generally be short heighted having plumpy body, small hands and small feet."],"appearanceMarathi":["सामान्य उंची, सडपातळ व स्नायूयुक्त शरीर, गव्हाळ वर्ण, बोलके डोळे, लांब चेहरा व कुरळे केस.","मध्यम उंची, रुंद कपाळ, जाड मान, तेजस्वी डोळे, काळे केस, गोरा वर्ण, रुंद खांदे, विकसित स्नायू व प्रसन्न व्यक्तिमत्त्व.","उंच व ताठ शरीर, मध्यम वर्ण, लांब हात, तीक्ष्ण डोळे, लांब नाक व आकर्षक व्यक्तिमत्त्व.","कमी उंची, जड शरीर, सडपातळ अवयव, बळकट पंजे व उठून दिसणारे पोट; वरचा भाग अधिक उठावदार व डोलणारी चाल.","मध्यम उंची, स्नायूयुक्त शरीर, विकसित हाडे, रुंद कपाळ, राजेशाही थाट, प्रतिष्ठित व प्रभावी व्यक्तिमत्त्व.","उंच व सडपातळ शरीर, तीव्र आवाज, वळणदार भुवया, दाट केस; वयापेक्षा तरुण दिसणे, चपळ हालचाली व जलद चाल.","उंची, प्रमाणबद्ध शरीर, सडपातळ पण बळकट अवयव, पोपटासारखे नाक, डौल, मानवतावादी वृत्ती व आकर्षक प्रभावी व्यक्तिमत्त्व.","सामान्य उंची, प्रमाणबद्ध शरीर, लांब हात, रुंद चेहरा, प्रभावी व आदरणीय व्यक्तिमत्त्व.","उंची, विकसित स्नायू, रुंद कपाळ, दाट भुवया, लांब नाक, तेजस्वी डोळे, हसरा चेहरा, गोरा वर्ण व देखणे रूप.","कृश व अशक्त बांधा, लांब नाक, खोल डोळे, खरखरीत केस व शरीराची मंद वाढ.","उंच, गोरा वर्ण व देखणे व्यक्तिमत्त्व.","कमी उंची, स्थूल शरीर, लहान हात व लहान पाय."]};
